# KiCad library 3D models that the KiCad boards under boards/ name, fetched from KiCad's own repo
# rather than shipped here. KiCad's library is CC-BY-SA 4.0 with an exception for designs that use
# it (PROVENANCE.md, "KiCad's 3D models"). `make remote` runs
#   hack/fetch_remote.sh remote/kicad-models.pin remote/kicad-models
# and each file lands in remote/kicad-models/<Library>.3dshapes/, the layout agni's --model-path
# reads. agni takes each part's height from its model (agni issue 1652).
#
# The commit is KiCad's 10.0.6 tag. Each file hashes the same as KiCad 10.0.6's installed library.
# The set covers every library model that Cynthion, Glasgow and MNT Reform name and KiCad 10's
# library still has. RoyalBlue54L's board file does not parse (agni issue 681), so its models are left
# out. A footprint that names a .wrl gets the .step beside it.
#
# <sha256>  <library folder>  <url at a fixed commit>
